package.descr:
AmneziaWG is a fork of WireGuard that gets past deep packet&lt;br /&gt;
				inspection. The cryptography is WireGuard's, unchanged; what&lt;br /&gt;
				differs is the shape of the packets on the wire, so a DPI box&lt;br /&gt;
				cannot recognise the handshake by its signature and block it.&lt;br /&gt;
				This package adds VPN &gt; AmneziaWG, managing tunnels and peers&lt;br /&gt;
				from the GUI along with the obfuscation parameters that make&lt;br /&gt;
				the traffic unrecognisable. The data plane is amneziawg-go in&lt;br /&gt;
				userspace, so no kernel module is required.
